abstract: >
  Experimental artifact (source code, orchestration scripts, aggregated
  results, and analysis pipeline) for a study that determines the validity
  envelope of a SimGrid/SMPI model of Fletcher (an anisotropic reverse time
  migration application) calibrated on single-GPU-per-node hardware, by
  running Fletcher's CUDA backend on Grid'5000's chuc cluster (four A100
  GPUs per node) across one to four nodes and bandwidths of 1, 10, and 25
  Gbit/s, and confronting the measurements against the simulated
  predictions.
license: MIT
